  "commit_message": "fix(activations): downgrade StateFileChanged send failure to debug (CLI-154) (#4561)\n\n## Proposed Changes\n\nThe state.json file-watcher callback in `flox-activations` logs at\n`error!` when its channel send fails. That channel only closes when the\nmain-loop receiver has been dropped, which happens during executive\nshutdown. A late file-change event arriving after shutdown then hits a\nclosed channel — an expected shutdown-ordering race, not a failure.\n\nThis false alarm is Sentry issue CLI-FLOX-3B: ",
